SUMMARY:The Other Room: Carter Deems
LOCATION:Alpharetta
DESCRIPTION:Carter Deems is a standup comic from Atlanta\, Georgia. He was 
 a cast member on the MTV show Wild ‘N Out and a writer on the TBS show Dr
 op The Mic. He was also a writer on the Emmy nominated series Epic Rap Batt
 les of History.\n\nIn 2025\, Carter won the Atlanta’s Funniest Competitio
 n at the Helium Comedy Club. Carter has also made appearances on CNN\, Funn
 y Or Die\, NPR\, Bravo TV and Snoop Dogg’s Gladiator School.\n\nThere is 
 a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with
  any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks pur
 chased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\n
 Management reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facili
 ty who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: http
 s://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/the-other-room-carter-deems/
